---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Open-source projects · opensource_community"
  description="Original open-source tooling for domestic HPC systems and selected collaborative scientific computing work."
>
  <section class="projects-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Open source · Systems engineering</div>
    <h1>Tools built from<br /><span>field experience.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">A focused portfolio of infrastructure for working with domestic supercomputing clusters—and contributions to scientific computing in the open.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="original-title">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">01</span>
        <h2 id="original-title">Original work</h2>
      </div>
      <p>One shared body of operational knowledge, delivered through two complementary interfaces.</p>
    </header>

    <article class="ecosystem">
      <div class="ecosystem-intro">
        <div class="project-label"><span></span>SCNet tooling ecosystem</div>
        <h3>Make difficult clusters<br />predictable to operate.</h3>
        <p>Practical knowledge and deterministic automation for SSH setup, Slurm jobs, failure diagnosis, and Hygon DCU/DTK development on scnet.cn and similar systems.</p>
        <div class="tag-list" aria-label="Technologies">
          <span>HPC</span><span>Slurm</span><span>Hygon DCU</span><span>Shell</span><span>Agent tooling</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="repository-list">
        <a class="repository" href="https://github.com/lql341/scnet-hpc" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <div class="repo-top"><span class="repo-number">CORE / 01</span><span class="external" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
          <h4>scnet-hpc</h4>
          <p>The canonical agent skill: cluster profiles, safe connection setup, compliant job generation, live capability probes, and field-tested troubleshooting guidance.</p>
          <div class="repo-meta"><span>Original</span><span>MIT</span><span>GitHub</span></div>
        </a>

        <a class="repository" href="https://github.com/lql341/dsh-scnet" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          <div class="repo-top"><span class="repo-number">INTEGRATION / 02</span><span class="external" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
          <h4>dsh-scnet</h4>
          <p>A DeepSeek Harness bundle that packages the shared skill and exposes seven deterministic tools for cluster discovery, SSH, Slurm, and compute-node probes.</p>
          <div class="repo-meta"><span>Original</span><span>DSH plugin</span><span>GitHub</span></div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="project-section collaboration" aria-labelledby="collaboration-title">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">02</span>
        <h2 id="collaboration-title">Collaborative work</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Contributions to a larger community-led scientific computing project.</p>
    </header>

    <a class="collaboration-card" href="https://github.com/eric2003/OneFLOW" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      <div class="collaboration-title">
        <span class="role">Contributor · 42 contributions</span>
        <h3>OneFLOW</h3>
      </div>
      <p>An open-source, large-scale multiphysics scientific simulation environment for computational fluid dynamics, built around C++, CMake, MPI, and heterogeneous acceleration.</p>
      <div class="collaboration-action"><span>View upstream repository</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="project-note">
    <span>Working principle</span>
    <p>Build the reusable layer, document the constraints, and leave enough evidence for the next person to reproduce the result.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-hero { padding: clamp(78px, 11vw, 142px) 0 96px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .projects-hero h1 { margin: 22px 0 28px; font-size: clamp(54px, 8vw, 102px); font-weight: 620; line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.07em; }
  .projects-hero h1 span { color: var(--muted); }
  .projects-hero .lead { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px); }
  .project-section { padding: 86px 0 104px; }
  .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 390px; gap: 64px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .section-heading > div { display: flex; gap: 22px; align-items: baseline; }
  .section-index, .project-label, .repo-number, .repo-meta, .role, .project-note > span { font: 700 10px/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .section-index { color: var(--accent); }
  .section-heading h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 55px); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .section-heading > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .ecosystem { overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(16,21,16,.98), rgba(7,9,7,.98)); }
  .ecosystem-intro { padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 58px); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .project-label { color: var(--accent); }
  .project-label span { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 18px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 70%, transparent); }
  .ecosystem-intro h3 { margin: 38px 0 24px; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 51px); font-weight: 590; line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  .ecosystem-intro > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .tag-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .tag-list span { padding: 6px 9px; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, transparent); border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; }
  .repository-list { display: grid; }
  .repository { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); text-decoration: none; transition: background .2s ease; }
  .repository + .repository { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .repository:hover { background: rgba(94,234,212,.045); }
  .repo-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--muted); }
  .external { color: var(--accent); font-size: 24px; transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .repository:hover .external { transform: translate(3px, -3px); }
  .repository h4 { margin: 24px 0 13px; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .repository p { max-width: 650px; margin: 0 0 32px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .repo-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; margin-top: auto; color: #6f796f; }
  .collaboration { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .collaboration-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1fr auto; gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 70px); align-items: center; padding: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 52px); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: rgba(13,17,13,.72); text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
  .collaboration-card:hover { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, var(--line)); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .role { color: var(--accent); }
  .collaboration-title h3 { margin: 17px 0 0; font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .collaboration-card > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .collaboration-action { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; color: var(--text); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .collaboration-action b { color: var(--accent); font-size: 25px; }
  .project-note { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 760px); gap: 50px; padding: 65px 0 88px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .project-note > span { padding-top: 8px; color: var(--accent); }
  .project-note p { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .section-heading, .ecosystem, .collaboration-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .section-heading { gap: 20px; }
    .ecosystem-intro { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .collaboration-card { align-items: start; }
    .collaboration-action { justify-content: space-between; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .projects-hero { padding: 68px 0 72px; }
    .project-section { padding: 68px 0 82px; }
    .section-heading > div { gap: 14px; }
    .ecosystem { border-radius: 16px; }
    .project-note { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .repository, .external, .collaboration-card { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
